= Prosh Proshian

Proshian (1883-1918), a Left SR, is People's Commissar of Posts and Telegraphs. He has the telegraph in his hands, and a network of operators who are loyal to the party.

- @action
- @root: Return to main

@action
title: Telegraph Lines
subtitle: Proshian's telegraph network carries news and the party's organisation.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer <= 0 and lsr_in_gov = 1
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before the next advisor action. ?][? if not (lsr_in_gov = 1) : We are not in the government. ?]
on-arrival: {!
Q.advisor_action_timer = 6;
Q.last_advisor_action = 1;
Q.month_actions += 1;
Q.insight = (Q.insight || 0) + 1; Q.members += 10 * Q.mem_scale; RO.boost(Q, {workers: 1, railway: 2}); RO.fac(Q, 'unions', 1, -2);
!}

The telegraphists of a dozen provincial towns now take their instructions from the party, and the party hears everything that goes over the wire.

